# The 128-bit words MiSTer runs for 007 - Everything or Nothing, taken byte
# for byte from MiSTer-devel/Cheats_MiSTer/Cheats/GBA, which gamehacking.org
# generates. Each .gg file there is a run of 16-byte records, four 32-bit
# little endian words, most significant first:
#
#     [127:96] [95:64] [63:32] [31:0]
#
# Only the low byte of the first word and the low 28 bits of the second are
# read by gba_cheats, so those are the bits kept here. This file is an oracle
# that owes nothing to our own decoder: it is a different implementation, by
# different people, of the same mapping from the same libretro codes.
#
# mister_007.cht is the matching libretro file with its enable keys switched on.
000000300201a45400000000000007b7  Infinite Time (Alternate Code).gg
000000100200e9240000000000000096  Infinite Health (Alternate Code).gg
00000010030034b80000000000000096  Infinite Health (Alternate Code).gg
0000002003003980000000000000ff00  Infinite Ammo (All Guns).gg
00000040030039800000000000ff0000  Infinite Ammo (All Guns).gg
000000800300398000000000ff000000  Infinite Ammo (All Guns).gg
000000800300397c0000000001000000  Always Have Silencer.gg
0000002002019ec4000000000000ff00  Have Alot Of Points (Shop).gg
